#: ../developer/index.md:1
msgid "HybridInference Cloud Agent"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/index.md:3
msgid ""
"Cloud Agent runs coding agents against a user's repository inside "
"retained sandbox containers. Users work from a web interface, while "
"enrolled hosts run Claude Code, Codex, pi, OpenCode, or Kilo. The control"
" plane coordinates jobs, sessions, and publication to source control. "
"Model access and account identity come from a [HybridInference "
"gateway](https://github.com/HarvardMadSys/hybridInference), over HTTP "
"only."
msgstr ""
"Cloud Agent 让编码 agent 在保留的沙箱容器里处理用户的仓库。用户在网页上操作，真正执行任务的是已注册的主机，上面跑着 "
"Claude Code、Codex、pi、OpenCode 或 "
"Kilo。控制平面负责调度任务、管理会话，并把改动发布到代码托管平台。模型调用和账号身份都来自 [HybridInference "
"网关](https://github.com/HarvardMadSys/hybridInference)，双方只通过 HTTP 通信。"

#: ../developer/index.md:10
msgid ""
"This is the documentation for the software itself: running it locally, "
"operating a deployment, understanding how it works, and contributing to "
"it. The source is at [github.com/HarvardMadSys/hybridInference-cloud-"
"agent](https://github.com/HarvardMadSys/hybridInference-cloud-agent), "
"under the MIT license; bugs and questions go to its [issue "
"tracker](https://github.com/HarvardMadSys/hybridInference-cloud-"
"agent/issues)."
msgstr ""
"这里是软件本身的文档：怎么在本地跑起来、怎么运维一套部署、它内部怎么运作，以及怎么参与贡献。源代码在 "
"[github.com/HarvardMadSys/hybridInference-cloud-"
"agent](https://github.com/HarvardMadSys/hybridInference-cloud-agent)，采用 "
"MIT 许可证。发现 bug 或有疑问，请到 [issue tracker](https://github.com/HarvardMadSys"
"/hybridInference-cloud-agent/issues) 提出。"

