#: ../developer/index.md:35
msgid ""
"These pages document the software, not any one installation of it. How "
"end users work with a particular deployment, which agents and models it "
"offers, and how to get an account there are the operator's to publish. "
"Dated designs, plans, and acceptance records stay in the repository as "
"engineering history and are linked from here where they explain a "
"decision."
msgstr ""
"这些页面讲的是软件本身，而不是某一套具体的部署。某个部署的终端用户怎么使用它、提供哪些 agent "
"和模型、怎么申请账号，由各自的运维方发布。带日期的设计、计划和验收记录作为工程历史留在仓库里；它们能说明某个决定的来龙去脉时，这里会附上链接。"

